---

<section id="contacto" class="cta">
	<div class="wrap cta-inner">
		<div>
			<h2>Hablemos de tu próxima campaña.</h2>
			<p>Contanos de tu marca, tu organización o tu comercio y armamos juntos un plan de contenido y pauta.</p>
			<div class="cta-actions">
				<a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="mailto:hola.chenzostudio@gmail.com">Escribir un email</a>
				<a class="btn btn-ghost-dark" href="https://www.instagram.com/chenzostudio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver Instagram</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="cta-contacts">
			{contacts.map((contact) => (
				<div class="cta-contact">
					<span class="cta-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={contact.icon} />
					</span>
					<div>
						<span class="label">{contact.label}</span>
						<a href={contact.href} target={contact.external ? '_blank' : undefined} rel={contact.external ? 'noopener' : undefined}>{contact.text}</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta {
		background: var(--brand-dark);
		color: #F6F7F6;
		border-top: none;
	}

	.cta-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
		gap: 56px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.cta h2 {
		font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 42px);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #F6F7F6;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.cta p {
		margin-top: 16px;
		font-size: 17px;
		color: #D9DAD8;
		max-width: 48ch;
	}

	.cta-actions {
		margin-top: 32px;
		display: flex;
		gap: 14px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.cta-contacts {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(238, 232, 221, 0.22);
		padding-left: 40px;
	}

	.cta-contact {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 14px;
		padding: 18px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(238, 232, 221, 0.16);
	}

	.cta-contact:first-child {
		padding-top: 0;
	}

	.cta-contact-icon {
		flex: none;
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		margin-top: 3px;
		color: var(--brand-light);
	}

	.cta-contact-icon svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}

	.cta-contact .label {
		font-size: 11px;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--brand-light);
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.cta-contact a {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 8px;
		font-size: 17px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #F6F7F6;
		word-break: break-word;
	}

	.cta-contact a:hover {
		color: var(--beige);
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.cta-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.cta-contacts {
			border-left: none;
			padding-left: 0;
			border-top: 1px solid rgba(238, 232, 221, 0.22);
			padding-top: 28px;
		}
	}
</style>
